hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"74","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Bashshar, qala: Haddasana Abu Dawud Tayalisi, qala: Haddasana Hammam, 'an, qala: Maine Anas bin Malik se kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki naal kaisi thi? Farmaya: Un dono ke do qibal the."
"75","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abu Kuraib Muhammad bin Al-'Alaa, qala: Haddasana Waki', 'an Sufyan, 'an Khalid Hadhdha', 'an Abdullah bin Harith, 'an Ibn Abbas, qala: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki naal ke do qibal the, aur un dono ki sharak mura hui thi."
"76","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ahmad bin Mani', qala: Haddasana Abu Ahmad Zubairi, qala: Haddasana 'Isa bin Tahman, qala: Anas bin Malik hamare pas do naaleen laaye jin mein baal na tha, un ke do qibal the. Qala: Phir Thabit ne baad mein Anas se mujhe bataya ke wo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki naal the."
"77","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ishaq bin Musa Ansari, qala: Haddasana Ma'n, qala: Haddasana Malik, qala: Haddasana Sa'id bin Abi Sa'id Maqburi, 'an Ubaid bin Juraij, ke unhone Ibn Umar se kaha: Maine aapko sibti naaleen pehne hue dekha. Farmaya: Maine Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko aisi naaleen pehne hue dekha jin mein baal na ho, aur unhein pehne hue wuzu farmate the, isliye main unhein pehna pasand karta hoon."
"78","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ishaq bin Mansur, qala: Haddasana Abdur-Razzaq, 'an Ma'mar, 'an Ibn Abi Dhi'b, 'an Salih mawla Taw'ama, 'an Abu Huraira, qala: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki naal ke do qibal the."
"79","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ahmad bin Munī', qala: haddasana Abu Ahmada, qala: haddasana Sufyān, 'anis-Suddi, qala: haddathanī man, sami'a 'Amr bin Hurayth yaqulu: main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko do jure hue jooton mein namaaz padhte dekha."
"80","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ishaq bin Musa Al-Ansari, qala: haddasana Ma'n, qala: haddasana Malik, 'an Abi Zinad, 'anil-A'raj, 'an Abi Huraira, ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: tum mein se koi ek joota pehan kar na chale, ya to dono pehan le ya dono utar de. Haddasana Qutaiba, 'an Malik bin Anas, 'an Abi Zinad isi ki misl."
"81","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ishaq bin Musa Al-Ansari, qala: haddasana Ma'n, qala: haddasana Malik, 'an Abi Zinad, 'anil-A'raj, 'an Abi Huraira, ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: tum mein se koi ek joota pehan kar na chale, ya to dono pehan le ya dono utar de. Haddasana Qutaiba, 'an Malik bin Anas, 'an Abi Zinad isi ki misl."
"82","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ishaq bin Musa, qala: haddasana Ma'n, qala: haddasana Malik, 'an Abi Zubair, 'an Jabir, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne is se mana farmaya ke shakhs apne bayen haath se khaye, ya ek joota pehan kar chale."
"83","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaiba, wa haddasana Ishaq bin Musa, qala: haddasana Ma'n, qala: haddasana Malik, 'an Abi Zinad, 'anil-A'raj, 'an Abi Huraira, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: jab tum mein se koi joota pehne to dayen se shuru kare, aur jab utare to bayen se shuru kare. Pas dayen ko pehle pehnaya jaye aur aakhir mein utara jaye."
"84","[AI-translation] Ham se Abu Musa Muhammad bin al-Muthanna ne hadees sunaai, kehne lage: ham se Muhammad bin Ja'far ne hadees sunaai, kehne lage: ham se Shu'bah ne hadees sunaai, kehne lage: ham se Ash'ath yani Ibn Abi Ash-sha'sha' ne apne waalid se, unhoon ne Masruq se, unhoon ne Ayesha se riwayat ki, farmati hain: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam baal sanwarne, naalein pehanne aur taharat mein jab tak mumkin ho daaye ki taraf se karna pasand farmate thay."
